  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/icon-ioc/ICON_0014208">
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The whole a target's percentages are of, in its indicator's unit, such as California's land area for a goal of conserving 30 percent of its lands. A target with a total is shown in both amounts and percentages.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
